{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 一次攻击的完整链路\n\n从玩家按键到敌人掉血，每一步落在哪个类上。\n\n**看这张图能回答**：某个环节出问题该去哪个文件找。\n每个节点先给伪代码，再讲为什么这样写。\n\n速查：[[模块参考]]　设计依据：[[计划蓝图]]","x":-1300,"y":-520,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"6"},

		{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"### 1　按键\n\n```\nUGGYGOInputComponent::BindAbilityActions(Config, ...):\n    for (Action, InputTag) in Config.AbilityInputActions:\n        Bind(Action, Started,   Pressed,  InputTag)\n        Bind(Action, Completed, Released, InputTag)\n\nHeroComponent::Input_AbilityInputTagPressed(InputTag):\n    ASC->AbilityInputTagPressed(InputTag)\n```\n\n按 InputTag 批量绑定，不是一个键写一个函数 ——\n加技能只改 `UGGYGOInputConfig` 资产，不动代码。","x":-800,"y":-700,"width":420,"height":280,"color":"4"},

		{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"### 2　入缓存（不激活）\n\n```\nASC::AbilityInputTagPressed(InputTag):\n    for Spec in ActivatableAbilities:\n        if Spec.DynamicSpecSourceTags.HasTagExact(InputTag):\n            InputPressedSpecHandles.AddUnique(Spec.Handle)\n            InputHeldSpecHandles.AddUnique(Spec.Handle)\n\nASC::AbilityInputTagReleased(InputTag):\n    ...\n    InputReleasedSpecHandles.AddUnique(Handle)\n    InputHeldSpecHandles.Remove(Handle)   // 否则 WhileInputActive 下帧还会激活\n```\n\n**用 `HasTagExact` 而非层级匹配**：InputTag 是具体按键语义，\n层级匹配会让 `InputTag.Attack` 的键误触发 `InputTag.Attack.Heavy` 的能力。\n\n**为什么按下不立刻激活**：见第 3 步的三阶段顺序。","x":-800,"y":-360,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"4"},

		{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"### 3　统一消费（每帧一次）\n\n```\nPlayerController::PostProcessInput(dt, bPaused):\n    ASC->ProcessAbilityInput(dt, bPaused)   // 先\n    Super::PostProcessInput(...)            // 后\n\nProcessAbilityInput:\n    if HasTag(Gameplay.AbilityInputBlocked):\n        ClearAbilityInput(); return    // 连 held 一起清\n\n    ① for h in Held:     若未激活且策略==WhileInputActive  → 收集\n    ② for h in Pressed:  Spec.InputPressed = true\n                         若已激活 → AbilitySpecInputPressed(传事件)\n                         否则策略==OnInputTriggered        → 收集\n    ③ for h in 收集:     TryActivateAbility(h)\n    ④ for h in Released: 已激活 → AbilitySpecInputReleased\n\n    Pressed.Reset(); Released.Reset()   // held 保留到真正松手\n```\n\n**激活必须在 ①② 收集之后**：否则 held 先激活了能力，\n紧接着 pressed 又把同一次按下当输入事件发给刚创建的实例，\n能力会收到一次它不该收到的 InputPressed。\n\n**在 `PostProcessInput` 里做**：这是引擎保证「本帧输入全部处理完」的点。\n在派发中途消费会让同帧内后到的按下推迟一帧，表现为偶发输入延迟。\n\n**先于 Super**：能力可能施加 `Restriction.CantMove`，\n先激活这一帧的移动就能立刻被限制住，不会多走一帧。","x":-800,"y":40,"width":420,"height":520,"color":"4"},

		{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"### 4　组仲裁\n\n```\nIsActivationBlockedByGroup(Ability, out Reason):\n    P = Ability.ActivationPriority\n\n    // 第一步：跨组 Exclusive 压制（死亡、被击倒、大招）\n    for 所有组的所有活跃能力 A:\n        if A.SelfPolicy == Exclusive and A.Priority > P:\n            Reason = ExclusiveActive; return true\n\n    if !Ability.GroupTag.IsValid(): return false   // 不参与仲裁\n\n    Rule = ResolveGroupRule(GroupTag)\n    if Rule == Coexist: return false              // 连遍历都省\n\n    // 第二步：同组冲突\n    for A in ActiveAbilitiesByGroup[GroupTag]:\n        if Rule == SingleInstanceQueued:\n            Reason = GroupOccupiedQueued; return true   // 不比优先级，一律拒绝\n\n        // SingleInstance：比优先级\n        blocked = Rule.bNewcomerWinsOnTie ? (A.P > P) : (A.P >= P)\n        if blocked: Reason = ...; return true\n```\n\n**普攻组配 `SingleInstanceQueued`**：组内有实例就拒绝、**不取消**已有的。\n配合 `AddAbilityToActivationGroup` 里「Queued 组不取消同组实例」，\n已激活那一段必然播完 —— 这是连段不被自己打断的保证。\n\n**平手规则与取消阈值严格互补**：阻断用 `>` 时取消用 `<=`（平手后来者胜，D4），\n阻断用 `>=` 时取消用 `<`（平手先到者守位，受击组要这个）。","x":-320,"y":-360,"width":460,"height":560,"color":"5"},

		{"id":"s4b","type":"text","text":"### 4b　被拒 → 缓冲重试\n\n```\nNotifyAbilityFailed(Handle, Ability, FailureReason):\n    if FailureReason.HasTagExact(ActivateFail.ActivationGroupQueued):\n        for SpecTag in Spec.DynamicSpecSourceTags:\n            if SpecTag.MatchesTag(InputTag):\n                OnAbilityInputRetryable.Broadcast(SpecTag)\n                break\n\n// 组空出来时\nRemoveAbilityFromActivationGroup:\n    更新 ActiveAbilitiesByGroup\n    if 组变空: OnAbilityGroupFreed.Broadcast(GroupTag)   // 更新之后才广播\n```\n\n**只对 `GroupOccupiedQueued` 广播重试**：其它失败原因（冷却、消耗不足、\nTag 阻断）重试也不会成功，广播只会让意图层反复空转。\n\n**广播必须在容器更新之后**：订阅者大概率在回调里立刻尝试激活，\n那次激活会走仲裁，必须看到已经清空的组状态。\n\n第二段在第一段播放中被拒 → 第一段结束时重试成功 = 连段。","x":180,"y":-380,"width":440,"height":420,"color":"3"},

		{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"### 5　能力激活\n\n```\nUGGYGOGameplayAbility::ActivateAbility(...):    // 基类先做\n    if AbilityCameraMode: SetCameraMode(...)\n    if !CameraOffset.IsNearlyZero(): ApplyCameraOffset(...)\n    Super::ActivateAbility(...)                 // 之后触发蓝图事件\n\n// 你写的攻击 GA 通常做三件事\n攻击 GA::ActivateAbility:\n    ApplyGameplayEffectToSelf(GE_BlockMoveOnly)   // 防位移叠加\n    Task = PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent(Montage, 事件Tag集)\n    Task->OnCompleted / OnInterrupted / OnCancelled / EventReceived 绑定\n    Task->ReadyForActivation()\n```\n\n**施加 `Restriction.CantMove`**：不加的话 locomotion 的位移与\n动作自身的位移会叠加，角色会「滑步出招」。\n\n相机两个字段是声明式配置，基类自动应用、`EndAbility` 自动撤销，\n不需要每个能力蓝图再写一遍。","x":-320,"y":260,"width":460,"height":420,"color":"5"},

		{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"### 6　播动画 + 等事件\n\n```\nUGGYGOAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent:\n    Activate():\n        绑 Montage 结束/打断/混出委托\n        绑 ASC->GenericGameplayEventCallbacks[Tag] → OnGameplayEvent\n        PlayMontage()\n\n    OnGameplayEvent(Tag, Payload):\n        EventReceived.Broadcast(Tag, Payload)   // 判定窗口从这里出\n\n    四种结束路径：\n        OnCompleted    自然播完   → 结算收招硬直\n        OnBlendOut     开始混出   → 可接下一段\n        OnInterrupted  被打断     → 不结算收招\n        OnCancelled    能力取消   → 全部回滚\n```\n\n**为什么合成一个 Task 而不是两个并联**：\nMontage 被打断后，独立的事件监听 Task 仍然活着，\n会接到下一个动画的同名事件 —— 表现为「上一刀的判定打在这一刀上」。\n\n四种结束语义不同，不能合并成一个「结束」回调。","x":180,"y":260,"width":440,"height":460,"color":"1"},

		{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"### 7　判定窗口\n\n```\n// Montage 时间轴上的 AnimNotify 发 GameplayEvent\nEvent.Montage.HitWindowBegin\n    → 攻击 GA 收到 EventReceived\n    → MeleeTraceComponent->BeginTraceWindow(起点骨骼, 终点骨骼, 半径)\n          HitActorsThisWindow.Reset()   // 每段独立计数\n          丢弃上一帧端点          // 窗口开启时武器可能已移动\n          bIsTracing = true\n\nEvent.Montage.HitWindowEnd\n    → EndTraceWindow():  bIsTracing = false\n```\n\n**每段窗口清空命中记录**：连招每段是独立的一次攻击，\n同一个敌人应当能被每段各命中一次。\n\n**丢弃上一帧端点**：不丢的话第一次扫掠会从窗口开启前的\n武器位置扫过来，凭空多打一段路径。","x":680,"y":260,"width":440,"height":420,"color":"1"},

		{"id":"s8","type":"text","text":"### 8　扫掠检测\n\n```\nTickComponent:  if bIsTracing: PerformTrace()\n\nPerformTrace():\n    Start = Mesh->GetSocketLocation(StartSocket)\n    End   = Mesh->GetSocketLocation(EndSocket)\n\n    for i in 0..4:                       // 武器分 5 个采样点\n        r    = i / 4\n        From = Lerp(PreviousStart, PreviousEnd, r)   // 上一帧\n        To   = Lerp(Start, End, r)                   // 本帧\n\n        SweepMultiByChannel(From, To, Sphere(Radius))\n\n        for Hit in Hits:\n            if HitActorsThisWindow.Contains(Hit.Actor): continue\n            HitActorsThisWindow.Add(Hit.Actor)\n            OnMeleeHit.Broadcast(Hit.Actor, Hit)\n\n    PreviousStart = Start; PreviousEnd = End\n```\n\n**扫上一帧到本帧的路径**：单帧位置检测在快速挥砍时会隧穿过敌人。\n\n**分 4 段而不是一条线**：单线段只覆盖武器中轴，\n而挥砍是武器**侧面**扫过敌人；分段后合起来覆盖整个扫过的面。\n\n**`SweepMulti` 而非 Single**：一次挥砍要能同时打到多个敌人。\n\n**窗口内去重**：不去重会让一刀造成多次伤害，且伤害量随帧率变化。","x":1180,"y":260,"width":460,"height":540,"color":"1"},

		{"id":"s9","type":"text","text":"### 9　应用伤害 GE\n\n```\n攻击 GA::OnMeleeHit(HitActor, Hit):\n    Spec = MakeOutgoingGameplayEffectSpec(GameData->DamageGameplayEffect_SetByCaller)\n    Spec->SetSetByCallerMagnitude(SetByCaller.Damage, 本段伤害)\n    Spec->SetSetByCallerMagnitude(SetByCaller.PoiseDamage, 本段削韧)\n\n    // 基类自动做：把命中的物理材质 Tag 并入 GE 目标 Tag\n    ApplyAbilityTagsToGameplayEffectSpec(Spec, AbilitySpec)\n\n    ApplyGameplayEffectSpecToTarget(Spec, TargetASC)\n```\n\n**GE 来自 `UGGYGOGameData` 而不是配在能力上**：\n施加者可能是能力、环境、跌落，共用一份伤害 GE。\n\n**`SetByCaller` 传每段伤害**：同一份 GE 服务整套连招，\n每段数值不同却不必各建一个 GE 资产。\n\n物理材质 Tag 并入目标 Tag 后，Execution 的材质衰减与 Cue 的\n表面分流都能读到它。","x":1180,"y":-380,"width":460,"height":460,"color":"5"},

		{"id":"s10","type":"text","text":"### 10　伤害结算\n\n```\nUGGYGODamageExecution::Execute_Implementation:\n    // 捕获定义（静态构造一次）\n    BaseDamageDef      = { CombatSet.BaseDamage,      Source, bSnapshot=true }\n    BasePoiseDamageDef = { CombatSet.BasePoiseDamage, Source, bSnapshot=true }\n\n    AttemptCalculateCapturedAttributeMagnitude(BaseDamageDef, → BaseDamage)\n\n    // SetByCaller 覆盖属性值（>= 0 才算设置过）\n    if Spec.GetSetByCallerMagnitude(SetByCaller.Damage, false, -1) >= 0:\n        BaseDamage = 该值\n\n    // 衰减系数由能力来源提供，不在这里写死\n    Atten = Source->GetPhysicalMaterialAttenuation(命中材质, ...)\n          * Source->GetDistanceAttenuation(距离, ...)\n\n    Final = Max(BaseDamage * Max(Atten, 0), 0)\n\n    AddOutputModifier(HealthSet.Damage, Additive, Final)   // 写元属性\n```\n\n**`bSnapshot=true`**：记下**挥刀那一刻**的攻击力。判定与落地隔着若干帧，\n取命中那一刻会让玩家觉得 Buff 白吃了。\n\n**写元属性而不是直接扣血**：免疫、钳制、死亡边沿全部集中在 HealthSet，\n各 Execution 自己扣血就要把这些规则重复实现一遍。\n\n衰减系数属于武器设计（打护甲还是软肉），Execution 只按公式合成。","x":1700,"y":-380,"width":480,"height":560,"color":"5"},

		{"id":"s11","type":"text","text":"### 11　属性变更\n\n```\nHealthSet::PreGameplayEffectExecute(Data):      // 拦截\n    if Attr == Damage and Magnitude > 0:\n        bSelfDestruct = Spec.DynamicAssetTags.HasTagExact(Damage.SelfDestruct)\n        if Target.HasTag(Damage.Immunity) and !bSelfDestruct:\n            Magnitude = 0                       // 闪避无敌帧\n        if Target.HasTag(Cheat.GodMode) and !bSelfDestruct:\n            Magnitude = 0\n\nHealthSet::PostGameplayEffectExecute(Data):     // 消费\n    MinHealth = 0\n    if 作弊保命 and !bSelfDestruct: MinHealth = 1\n\n    if Attr == Damage:\n        广播伤害消息（Magnitude 是未 Clamp 的原始值）\n        SetHealth(Clamp(Health - Damage, MinHealth, MaxHealth))\n        SetDamage(0)          // 必须清零\n    elif Attr == Healing:\n        SetHealth(Clamp(Health + Healing, ...)); SetHealing(0)\n\n    if Health <= 0 and !bOutOfHealth:\n        OnOutOfHealth.Broadcast(...)\n\n    // 广播之后再读一次：监听者可能在回调里又改了属性\n    bOutOfHealth = (Health <= 0)\n    bPoiseBroken = (Poise <= 0)\n```\n\n**元属性必须清零**：不清的话后续 GE 会重复消费同一份伤害。\n\n**边沿锁存在广播之后更新**，且用重新读取的值 ——\n破韧监听者可能立刻施加硬直 GE 改变属性，用旧值会算错边沿。\n\n**自毁绕过一切保命**：自毁的定义就是必须死成。","x":1700,"y":260,"width":480,"height":620,"color":"5"},

		{"id":"s12","type":"text","text":"### 12　反馈\n\n```\nHealthComponent::InitializeWithAbilitySystem(ASC):\n    HealthSet = ASC->GetSet<UGGYGOHealthSet>()\n    HealthSet->OnHealthChanged.AddUObject(...)   // 原生委托\n    HealthSet->OnOutOfHealth.AddUObject(...)\n\nHandleOutOfHealth(...):\n    → OnDeathStarted 动态委托（蓝图/UI 订阅）\n    → ASC->HandleGameplayEvent(Event.Death)     // 不直接改状态\n\nGameplayCueNotify_HitImpact::OnExecute(Params):\n    for Entry in SurfaceEffects:                // 更具体的排在前\n        if Params.AggregatedTargetTags.HasTag(Entry.SurfaceTag):\n            生成 Niagara + 音效; return\n    用 DefaultEffect 兜底\n```\n\n**生命归零发 `Event.Death` 而非直接切状态**：死亡演出（倒地动画、\n战利品、UI）由死亡 GA 承载，它能被复制与预测，直接改状态不能。\n\n**Cue 按 GE 目标 Tag 分流**：打金属出火花、打肉出血。\n那个 Tag 是第 9 步并进去的物理材质 Tag。","x":2240,"y":-380,"width":480,"height":560,"color":"1"},

		{"id":"note","type":"text","text":"## 排查指引\n\n| 症状 | 先看哪 |\n|---|---|\n| 按键完全没反应 | InputConfig 的 Tag 配置、`DefaultInputComponentClass` |\n| 单次能触发、连段接不上 | 组规则是否 `SingleInstanceQueued`、重试缓冲是否接了 `OnAbilityGroupFreed` |\n| 动画播了但打不到人 | 判定窗口 Notify、`TraceChannel`、骨骼名、`bIsTracing` 是否真的开了 |\n| 一刀打好几次 | `HitActorsThisWindow` 去重失效，或窗口 Notify 成对性被破坏 |\n| 打到了但不掉血 | GameData 的伤害 GE、Execution 是否写了元属性、目标有无 HealthSet |\n| 伤害数值不对 | `SetByCaller` 是否设了、`bSnapshot` 取的是哪一刻、衰减系数 |\n| 无敌帧不生效 | Tag 是 `Gameplay.Damage.Immunity` 而非旧的 `Restriction.Invincible` |\n| 掉血但没特效 | Cue 是否在 `Content/GameplayCues/`、是否在 `CuesToPreload` 里预热 |\n| 死亡没反应 | 是否有能力监听 `Event.Death`（当前四个 GA 仍是空壳） |","x":2240,"y":260,"width":880,"height":420,"color":"6"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","label":"InputTag"},
